# Violin
# V, Warmup
# ↑↓
{stops=`thirds fourths sixths octaves tenths harm unisons`;}
{shapes=`dim sixths ysaye tonic squares`;}
{modes=`1 2 3 4 5 6 7`;}
-=- scales
-=- scale-stops
ScaleStopsString: [key] [ss(stops)] [zipLongest(ss(`DAE`), ':', ss(`0+H-W+H, 0+W-H`), ss(`1234`))]
-=- bowing
BowingRainbow: [zipLongest(s('33% 50% 66%'), `:`, zipLongest(ss('G Dd Du Ad Au E'), ss(`GD DAu DAd AE`)).flat(), `:`, ss('up down'))] [metroS(42, 4)]metro:show-1:inline
BowDistribution: [ss(`12345678`)]:computed [\[...ss(`G D A E`), ...ss(`GD DA AE EA AD DG G D A E GD DA AE EA AD DG GDA DAE EAD ADE GDG DGD DAD ADA AEA EAE`)\]]:show-1 [metroS(50, 8)]metro:show-2:inline
Entrances: [zipLongestShuf(ss(`GDAE`), ss(`0/1 1/1 1/2↑ 1/2↓ 1/4↑ 1/4↓ 3/4↑ 3/4↓ 1/3↑ 1/3↓ 2/3↑ 2/3↓`), ss(`Long Marc Spidey Fade SewMach`))]:show-4
# Directions: [ss(`↑↓↑↓↑↓↑↓`)] [ss(`↑↓↑↓↑↓↑↓`)] [ss(`↑↓↑↓↑↓↑↓`)] [ss(`↑↓↑↓↑↓↑↓`)] 
Directions: [shuffle(timesUntil(8, shuffle(uniq(loopSubstringsG(`G,:D:A:E'`.split(':'), 3, 2))).at(0)))]over:hide [zipLongest(fields.over, ss(`vvvvnnnn`)).map(a=>a.join(''))]sheet:computed:hide [metroS(50, 8)]metro:show-1:inline 
BowGym: [ss(`lowWrist seesaw minesweep frisbee rotate fwcircle bwcircle zigzaglevels lasso4 upDown2`)]
FroschColle: [zipLongest(\[...ss(`GDAE`), ...ss(`GD DG DA AD AE EA`)\], ss(`↑↓↑↓`))]
AsymDistr: [zipLongest(\[...ss(`GDAE`), ...ss(`GD DG DA AD AE EA`)\], ss(`↑↓↑↓`))] 2+1  [metroS(50, 8)]metro:show-1:inline
-=- shifting
#{after('2026-03-16', '')}ShiftingFourth: [key] position 4 [(`octaves from 1st, shifts 1-4 ${ss(`0 -1 +1`).join(' ')}, shifts interleaved`)] [ss(`G D A E`)]
0x ShiftingSlides: [key] [(ss(`GDAE`).map(s=>chromaticSlide(key, s))).join(', ')]
ShiftingSlides: quartertone [key] [ss(`GDAE`).map(s=>chromaticSlide(key, s))]
{after('2026-04-05', '')}ShiftingSevcik: [key] Sevcik, no gliss [ss(`G D A E`)]
ShiftingSnake: [key] position: [ss(`2 3 4 5 6 7`)], [ss(`G D A E`)]
SemitoneFrame: [ss(`GDEA`)] +[ss(`1 2 3 4 5 6 7`)]sem [zip(ss(`lyd, maj, min, phyr, `),shuffle(perm('1234')).map(x=>x.join('')))]
# ShiftingAgainstWall: [ss(`snake, scale, ysaye`)]
UnisonShifts: [ss(`GDAE`)] +[ss(`3 4 5 6 7`)]sem
-=- vibrato
Vibrato: [ss(`12345678`)]:computed [shuffle(frets(10))]:show-4 [ss(`↑↓↑↓`)] spitze narrow [metroS(42, 4)]metro:show-1:inline [`11f`]next
# V, Technique
--- extensions
# Ext1: 4 finger: [zip(shuffleX(`3rd/, 4th/, 4#/, 5th/`, 2), ss(scalePositions({arrows: false})))]
--- bowings
# Bowing1: sautille, {ss(`DG AD EA`).map(str => str + ` ` + ss(`40 31 22 13`).join(':'))}
# Bowing2: E-G connection [divide(shuffleX(`GEu EGd`, 4), 2).join(' | ')] (arches)
# Bowing3: marcato with control over [pick(shapes)], [ss(`GDAE`)], [divide(ss(`1 2 3 4 5 6`), 2).flat()]
# Bowing4: fast draws [pick(shapes)]
# Bowing5: contact point randomization (circles)
--- stops
# Stop1: Bowing: 4-stops [ss(`sixths-interspersed, full`)] 
# Stop3: Fingerboard: sixths: sliding fingers over fifths, flat pads
--- entrances
Entr1: bow ends clicks exercise [ss(`GDAE`)]
# Entr2: entrances in tips [ss(`GDAE`)] # generalizable as entr1
# Entr3: entrances down, with stability and power
